				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					515
				</span></i>
			; esp. from the inland to the sea-coast, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.1.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				1.9.7
			</span></i>(
