					Luc.
					<u>DDeor.</u>
					20.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					2.12.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
